ough our news s","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-19T14:11:42Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706690438","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5020510-1846651706674617","game_id":"steam-5020510","kind":"announcement","title":"Wolfpire 0 | Dev Diary 1: How it started","summary":"Hello there!Being here is clearly the occasion to explain what's going on in my head since the beginning of Wolfpire 0's development. I'll share you all about my thoughts, my games references, my intentions, some concept arts... and plenty more stuffs until my game is released on Steam!1/ How did it even start?Well, after the end of the game development of Heart Fix Express (our first game we needed to kill 😥), Red, Armel and I wanted to have more financial and creative independence. So, lots of","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-14T15:13:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706674617","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5020510-1846018067926291","game_id":"steam-5020510","kind":"announcement","title":"Wolfpire 0 is coming soon!","summary":"Hello fellow anomalies hunters,We’re excited to finally introduce Wolfpire 0, an anomaly game inspired by French folklore and vampire legends where you have to observe your surroundings, spot any anomalies and find a way out from a mansion with endless corridors. Wolfpire 0 is designed as a troubling experience in PSX's style focused on spotting a pattern/anomaly in the objects and entities around you. Throughout the game, you have two options: turn back if you come across anything out of the or","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-07T14:12:15Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067926291","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:39:11Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5020510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:34Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:33Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5020510":"2026-10-26T07:15:34Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5020510":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:33Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:33Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:33Z"},"5089500":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:34Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:34Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T07:15:34Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5020510","app_id":5020510,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:17Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"6e63e59307935c3d482b611fd00a2fff09cd39f45fa9da5fe433cc9c12b725e0","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"You wake up in a mansion with endless corridors.\r\nTake a good look around you, spot the anomalies and escape from this place.\r\n","publishers":[{"name":"Keur Collectif","creator_clan_account_id":46111546}],"developers":[{"name":"Keur Collectif","creator_clan_account_id":46111546}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_date_message":"출시 예정","coming_soon_display":"text_comingsoon"},"trailers":{"highlights":[{"trailer_name":"Wolfpire 0 - Announcement Trailer","trailer_url_format":"steam/apps/${FILENAME}?t=1791381632","trailer_category":2,"microtrailer":[{"filename":"5020510/1211063124/1f8225ddc1396d0b1f0dcdcfd18221d8c8860742/1791305